00:08:59.000 --> 00:09:54.000
to Victoria Park Lake, close to the heart of the city, arriving a little after 9pm. The park lands surrounding the water had been a grazing paddock before they were transformed into public gardens with a swimming pool built into the lake itself. At night, the area was a popular lover's lane for local teens and young adults. When Gary pulled up, there was a station wagon with two couples inside, parked nearby with its lights on and another car next to it. Gary parked by the pool and the boys drank beer and offered Abena and Janice cans of vodka with orange juice. Janice had one and Abena drank a few, making her somewhat giddy and unsteady. The girls got out of the car to get some fresh air and visit the public toilets close by.

